# dynatrace_openpipeline_v2_usersessions_pipelines (Data Source)

-> This data source requires the OAuth scope `settings:objects:read`.

The `dynatrace_openpipeline_v2_usersessions_pipelines` data source retrieves all matching user session pipeline configurations.

